WEBVTT

00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:04.656
Click New Lead.

00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:09.629
Besides the name and the contact methods, a lead has a Lead status,

00:00:09.629 --> 00:00:14.125
a Company, a Lead source, a List, a Rating and a Lead owner.

00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:20.704
New leads get the default status.

00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:25.971
Pick the source from your lead sources, give the list a name, and choose a rating.

00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:27.109
Then publish.

